{"id":"665110","name":"人参羊肉汤","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/665110/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"羊肉","amount":"250g"},{"name":"人参","amount":"10g"}],"sub":[{"name":"枸杞","amount":"15g"},{"name":"葱","amount":"3g"},{"name":"姜","amount":"3g"},{"name":"纯净水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"宁夏枸杞备用。","img":"images/665110/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"人参和枸杞备用。","img":"images/665110/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"羊肉洗净，切块。","img":"images/665110/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"人参和枸杞子洗净，用清水浸泡30分钟。","img":"images/665110/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"葱段和姜备用。","img":"images/665110/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"葱花备用。","img":"images/665110/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"浸泡好的人参和枸杞放入砂锅中。","img":"images/665110/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"置火上，大火烧开后转小火煎30分钟。","img":"images/665110/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"人参和枸杞捞出，放入盘中。","img":"images/665110/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"砂锅中的人参枸杞汁备用。","img":"images/665110/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入羊肉块、葱段、姜片和没过锅中食材的清水。","img":"images/665110/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"小火炖至羊肉烂，加少许盐调味即可。","img":"images/665110/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"盛入盆中，撒上葱花即食。","img":"images/665110/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"健康又营养的药膳汤。","img":"images/665110/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}